{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は一日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ?ロケをしてました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいつもより早く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰れるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくりお風呂につかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体を休めよーっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、こないだのGirlPOPTVの時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、りんごと一緒に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2012/10/19/%E3%81%95%E3%81%8F%E3%82%89%E3%81%841.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スゴい楽しい事をしてきたので、OA是非見てくださいね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最近のハマりモノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東急プラザ 表参道店"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の2Fにある小さいオープンカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここの、スムージーとアイスが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ美味しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に、このスムージー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『リンゴとセロリのスムージー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セロリが苦手なひとでも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"控えめな甘さで さっぱり!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とぉーても飲みやすいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になる方は是非"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『LOAVES』の向かいにあるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に質問に答えます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊これだけは誰にも負けないって思うのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>顔のパーツがハッキリしてるところかな(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、ここは自分の個性!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きって言ってくれる人もいるから♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊れいかは顔覚えるの得意な方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>顔を覚えるのは、得意な方だと思います!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、いつ頃会った?とか聞かれると...；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々信じてもらえてないかも；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じる時があるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えてない時は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「すみません；」て謝るので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じてもらえたら嬉しいな(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ......名前を覚えるのは結構苦手です(-_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも頑張るねっo(｀^´*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊もっともっと応援していいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>何故そんなわかりきったことを聞くのですか???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モチのロンではないですかぁぁぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ、応援して貰いたいです!!皆さんあっての、乃木坂 桜井玲香ですからねっ!!!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊キャプテンということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のみんなをまとめるのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"工夫していること何かありますか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>そうですね〜、色々あります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身しつこく注意されるのが、あまり好きではないので...細かい注意は私はしていません。マネージャーさんが言ってくださったり、メンバー同士が呼び掛けて注意し合う場合が多いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、リハやレッスンの時に気合いが足りないかな〜と感じた時などは、さりげなく「テンションあげていきましょーう!!!」と声がけしたりはするようにしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、メンバーのちょっとした変化に気づいてあげられる様に気にしたりしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループが良くなるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張っていきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/19/4235257/0009.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}